<title>HONG KONG: HK 91-day bills average accepted yield 4.93 pct.</title>
<headline>HK 91-day bills average accepted yield 4.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield of 91-day Exchange Fund bills at Tuesday's tender was 4.93 percent, the Hong Kong Monetary Authority said.</p>
<p>This compares with three-month HIBOR of 5.51136 percent at 0330 GMT and the average accepted yield of 4.92 percent at the previous tender on November 5.</p>
<p>Bids for the HK$2 billion issue were at HK$14.17 billion against the previous HK$8.24 billion.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
